/-! # The E1G run of class 619 (R = 23) with search jobs (generated by a script)

Top chain: 142 blocks (`TopL`), checked in `TB*`, glued in `TG*` (`HT`: job headers, glue witnesses `Wf`); 9707
search jobs checked in `J*` (small jobs, `GJ.jobB`) and `K*` (big jobs, by parts). `enum_of_chain_w` gives the
canonical-point statement, `GJ.e1_sound_enum` the E1 conclusion with the IP facts (`ipok`, `rows`), and
`rowValid_of_e1` the class's row. Totals: 18176 pieces, 7952612 + 1020845685 literal bits; model stats F=9743 K=2590070 L=5440 P1=236451 P2=33302 child=3064215 cut0=1209 cut1=182476 cut2=9785 cut3=5483 fixed=128435 nodes=2789023 satev=4358488 skip0=763441 skipNC=65422 startsat=5639. -/

namespace B334.E1x.R619
